  the document start and `\appendix`), while permitted after `\appendix`.
  Per the CI polarity rule this is a body-scoped negative guard — forbid
  the jargon where it must not appear; do not pin a positive replacement.
- Keep the existing conditional ρ/in-sample-caveat guard green (update
